Depends: uhttpd, uhttpd-mod-ucode, ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, ucode-mod-ubus, ucode-mod-uloop, ucode-mod-digest, openssl-util, px5g-mbedtls, umdns
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
